<title>SPAIN: FCAST - Telefonica H1 profit seen up 20.5 pct.</title>
<headline>FCAST - Telefonica H1 profit seen up 20.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Market forecasts of first half consolidated results for Telefonica de Espana SA. Figures are in billions of pesetas versus the same period a year earlier and are calculated on the basis of simple averages.</p>
<p>				   H1 96	H1 95	RANGE</p>
<p> Net attrib. profit	  72.50	60.15   72.0 -  73.1</p>
<p> Operating income	   939.28     852.55  942.0 - 937.0</p>
<p> Operating margin	   522.00     499.32  536.0 - 515.0</p>
<p>Contributors: Ahorro Corporacion, Merrill Lynch, AB Asesores, BBV Interactivos and Credit Lyonnais Securities.</p>
<p>Telefonica is expected to announce results on Friday Aug 30.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
